#30771
Boat House~
This small warehouse is cluttered with boats in various stages of repair.  
Sawdust covers the floor, no doubt created in the sculpting of the vessels.  
This shop makes any size boat, from a small raft, to an ocean going vessel.  
If you need a boat, you've come to the right place.    
