Climbing the Tree~
   Steps have been masterly carved in to the tree, creating a way to get up the
highest level of the city.  Though the steps are sturdy, the agility required
to climb up or down speaks highly of the skills of the Elven people.  One may
continue climbing to get to the top of the ladder, or go back down into the
heart of the city.    
