#30783
In the Trees~
   The center of the City is way below, and the view offered from this height
is breathtaking.  Platforms have been attached together to allow safe
passageway along these upper reaches of the tree.  A sturdy railing along the
edge of the platform assures that all who come to enjoy the view will not fall
to their deaths.  This place is used for numerous reasons, be it for watching
for intruders, or merely observing the beautiful surroundings.    
~
